<title>JAPAN: Shiseido rises on foreign buying.</title>
<headline>Shiseido rises on foreign buying.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shiseido Co Ltd shares were higher in Thursday afternoon trade, lifted by foreign investors especially after so-called defensive stocks, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0355 GMT, the shares were 30 yen higher at 1,610.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors are hurrying to buy the shares ahead of the new fiscal year, when trade in stocks which are immune to fluctuations in the economy is expected to increase,&quot; a broker at a medium-sized brokerage said.</p>
</text>
